=========================================================
MOST ASKED INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
=========================================================

Q1. What is Cohesion?

The degree to which the responsibilities of a class are related.

High cohesion is desirable.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q2. What is Coupling?

The degree of dependency between classes.

Low coupling is desirable.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Difference between Cohesion and Coupling?

Cohesion
• Within a class
• High is good

Coupling
• Between classes
• Low is good

---------------------------------------------------------

Q4. What is DRY?

Avoid duplicating code by keeping common logic in one place.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q5. What is KISS?

Choose the simplest solution that satisfies the requirements.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q6. What is YAGNI?

Implement only what is currently required, not speculative future features.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q7. What does "Program to an Interface" mean?

Depend on interfaces or abstract classes rather than concrete implementations.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q8. Why prefer Composition over Inheritance?

• Loose coupling
• Better flexibility
• Easier maintenance
• Easier testing
• Avoids fragile inheritance hierarchies

